# CODEOWNERS file for automatic reviewer assignment
# 
# This file defines who should be automatically requested as a reviewer
# when a pull request touches specific files or directories.
#
# Format: <file-pattern> @username1 @username2 @org/team-name
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Each line is a file pattern followed by one or more owners.
# The pattern can use glob syntax (* matches any string except /, ** matches any string including /)
#
# For more information, see:
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

